Wiring for web/components/vault-detail.tsx, applied when the UI hook allows .tsx writes.
Two edits; everything else in the file stays as it is.

1. Import, after the DepositPanel import line:

   import { DepositPanel } from "./deposit-panel";
   import { EarnBorrow } from "./earn-borrow";
   import { ExitPreview } from "./exit-preview";

2. Render, directly under ExitPreview in the "mt-12 space-y-14" column:

   <ExitPreview vault={cfg.vault} symbol={cfg.symbol} user={address} />
   <EarnBorrow cfg={cfg} />

EarnBorrow returns null for a vault with no entry in lib/collateral-markets.json, so every vault page is unchanged until an oracle is deployed.

After dropping both files in: cp components/earn-borrow.tsx.draft components/earn-borrow.tsx, apply the two edits, then run npm test, npx tsc --noEmit, npm run build:pages.
